sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor You
  participant VS as VS Code
  participant AI as AI agent
  participant SC as Scripts (scripts/)
  participant PBI as Power BI Desktop
  participant Git as Git
  participant GH as GitHub
  You->>VS: Open repo, create branch
  VS->>SC: pbip-session-brief.ps1 (rules + bridge status)
  You->>VS: Copy specs/TEMPLATE.md, fill in the spec
  You->>AI: "Build this spec"
  AI->>AI: Read .github/copilot-instructions.md, skills, spec
  AI->>VS: Write TMDL (model) then PBIR (report) files
  VS->>SC: write-guard + validate-hook on each file
  AI->>SC: validate-json, validate-pbip, Test-PbipSemantics
  SC-->>AI: OK, or errors to fix
  AI->>SC: Invoke-PbipVerify.ps1 -Mode Review
  SC->>PBI: reload through the Desktop Bridge
  PBI-->>SC: screenshot of every page
  SC-->>AI: PNGs + page names + status
  AI->>You: Findings by page display name
  You->>Git: Review diff, commit
  Git->>GH: Push branch, open pull request
  GH->>GH: Review, merge to dev, then test
  GH->>GH: ai-testing.yml runs on test
  GH-->>You: Test results artifact
